1. plain words: greet who num
2. names: $greet / $greet<you> / $num
3. environment: $NOISE_SIGIL_GREETING
4. literal $: \$greet, $5, US$ 3, a lone $ sign
5. literal $ through macros: $shell / $repeat<count=2>(text=\$HOME)
6. unknown names expand to nothing: [$nosuch] [$nosuch] [$missing]
